WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
CADRec reconstructs editable CAD from point clouds.

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
The model uses local geometry to recursively split each shape.

00:08.000 --> 00:10.000
We generate CAD code per part,

00:10.000 --> 00:13.000
then merge parts in global coordinates.

00:13.000 --> 00:19.500
The results are structured, editable CAD sequences for diverse shapes.
